+    /**
+     * Evaluates and performs migration between {@code tablet_normal} and {@code tablet_compact}
+     * for tablet devices, supporting symmetric cross-device backup and restore.
+     *
+     * <p>Separates cloud-backed semantic state ({@link LauncherPrefs#COMPACT_TABLET_GRID_MIGRATION_V1})
