+     *
+     * <p>Symmetric cross-device restore behavior:
+     * <ul>
+     *   <li>Large -> Compact: Restores tablet_normal (backedUp=false) -> reevaluates hardware ->
+     *       selects tablet_compact (backedUp=true, localChecked=true).</li>
+     *   <li>Compact -> Large: Restores tablet_compact (backedUp=true) -> reevaluates hardware ->
+     *       selects tablet_normal (backedUp=false, localChecked=true).</li>
+     *   <li>Post-migration user override: Restores tablet_normal or otherGrid with backedUp=true ->
+     *       preserved without re-migration.</li>
+     *   <li>Same-device restarts: localChecked=true -> immediate return without distance calculation.</li>
+     * </ul>
+     *
+     * <p>Restart safety note: Writes to multiple SharedPreferences files cannot be transactionally
+     * atomic, but each partial write state converges cleanly on the subsequent boot.
